  vendorName: Baron Harrington
  offerText: My estate is being audited! Allow me to hide this breathtaking marble
    fountain in your parlor for free. Its beauty is yours to enjoy.
  acceptResultText: The massive fountain is absolutely stunning. You spend the hour
    admiring its craftsmanship, feeling like royalty.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to harbor hidden assets. You look at your sturdy,
    undamaged floor and feel deeply relieved.
  acceptedDelayedText: The heavy fountain collapses through your floorboards! You
    fall with it, injuring your back, and your landlord forces you to pay for all
    the damages.
